@startuml
' Voucher - Update (Admin) class diagram aligned to source code
title Voucher - Update (Admin) - class diagram
class VoucherRoutes {
  +updateVoucher(req,res)
  +updateVoucherStatus(req,res)
  +...()
}
class AuthMiddleware {
  +requireAuth(req,res,next)
  +requireRole(role)(req,res,next)
}
class VoucherController {
  +updateVoucher(req,res)
  +createVoucher(req,res)
  +getVoucher(req,res)
  +deleteVoucher(req,res)
  -- validation/normalization logic (normalize code, validate pct/usage/expiry)
}
class Voucher {
  -code: String
  -discountPercent: Number
  -expiryDate: Date
  -usageLimit: Number
  -status: String
  +findOne(filter)
  +findByIdAndUpdate(id, updates, opts)
  +findById(id)
  +create(doc)
}
database MongoDB

VoucherRoutes --> AuthMiddleware : uses
VoucherRoutes --> VoucherController : calls (updateVoucher)
VoucherController --> Voucher : calls (findOne, findByIdAndUpdate)
Voucher --> MongoDB : update operation
@enduml